{"metadata":{"title":"MISOListItemData","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents16MISOListItemDataV","symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","beta":false}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/Slot"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/init(key:overline:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/init(key:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/init(label:accessibilityLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/init(label:accessibilityLabel:overline:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/init(label:overline:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData\/Label"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOListItemData"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Navigations"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a mandatory label (either a ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or a custom ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and optional description, overline,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extra label, and helper text, and slots.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (String)","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: \"Label\")","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: \"Label\", hasBoldLabel: true)","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with text label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        hasBoldLabel: false,","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with custom view label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            Text(\"Title\").font(.headline)","            Text(\"Subtitle\").font(.caption)","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Title, Subtitle\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Overline as a user-styled rich text (AttributedString)","    \/\/ Same \"overline\" parameter name as the String variant, disambiguated by the value's type.","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: .from(text: \"Overline\",","                        foregroundColor: theme.colors.contentBrandPrimary.color(for: colorScheme),","                        font: someFont)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    MISOStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    MISONavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"]},{"text":"Custom view label","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Custom-view-label"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When providing a custom view as label:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasBoldLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" property is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must provide an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Small size behavior","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Small-size-behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the ","type":"text"},{"code":".misoListItemSize(.small)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"overline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"extraLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" properties are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"automatically hidden","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" to ensure a compact layout.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Only the ","type":"text"},{"code":"label","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"description","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" remain visible.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"bottomSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is also ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"automatically hidden","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", but the ","type":"text"},{"code":"textSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" remains displayed.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    MISOStaticListItem(data: MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .misoListItemSize(.small)"]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 3.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolistitemdata"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData"},"abstract":[{"text":"Represents the main content displayed within a list item component such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOStaticListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOListItemData/init(key:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)":{"title":"init(key:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:text